    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "JB Kelly presents this generous four-bedroom semi-detached residence, with about 150 sqm of accommodation in a well-located Sutton setting. It sits beside a large area of open green space, so the house benefits from an open aspect and has no direct overlooking to the front.\r\n\r\nAn entrance porch opens into the hallway, where a guest WC is located. From there, the living room flows into a second sitting room, creating two linked reception areas for family use, and a separate kitchen/breakfast room provides space for day-to-day meals.\r\n\r\nThe former garage has been altered and extended to the rear, forming a self-contained unit with its own kitchen, living space, bedroom, and bathroom. This gives the property substantial versatility: it may suit an extended family member, serve as a ground-floor bedroom, or function as a playroom or home office. If the relevant criteria are met, a buyer might also consider its possible rental income and whether it could qualify for the Rent-a-Room Relief scheme.\r\n\r\nOn the first floor there are four bedrooms together with a family bathroom. Along with the extra ground-floor accommodation, the layout provides ample space for a household that is growing or changing.\r\n\r\nThe nearby green area is well suited to children at play or dog walking, and Bayside Shopping Centre meets everyday shopping needs. Crèches, primary and secondary schools are all close by, as are bus and DART links and the seafront cycle track.\r\n\r\nWith its spacious floor area, open outlook and flexible side accommodation, 356 Sutton Park presents a practical family home with room to adapt over time. Contact JB Kelly to arrange a viewing."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground floor\r\n\r\nExtended porch to entrance hall\r\n2.10 x 5.50m\r\nTimber floors, storage closet.\r\n\r\nGuest WC\r\n1.55 x 0.90m\r\nTiled walls and floors, WC & WHB.\r\n\r\nLiving room\r\n3.25 x 5.10m\r\nTimber floors, open fireplace with black stone hearth , cast iron inset and hardwood syrround.\r\nDouble door through to…\r\n\r\nSitting room\r\n4.50 x 4.00m\r\nTimber floors, fireplace with gas fire insert, black stone hearth and hardwood surround.\r\nDoors through to…\r\n\r\nKitchen Breakfast Room\r\n3.30 x 4.10m\r\nTiled walls and splashbacks. Range of fitted wall and floor mounted shaker units. Double oven,  hob with extractor over, fridge freezer, dishwasher.\r\nGlazed door to rear garden.\r\n\r\nSelf contained unit / garage conversion\r\n\r\nLiving Room to Kitchen\r\n2.25 x 5.20m\r\nOpen plan, laminate floor in living space with tiled utility area to kitchen\r\nRange of floor and wall mounted units, Oven, hob, extractor, fridge freezer, washer dryer.\r\nDoor through to…\r\n\r\nBedroom\r\n3.70 x 2.15\r\nLaminate floor, built-in wardrobe, roof window over\r\n\r\nShower Room WC\r\n2.25 x 1.10\r\nTiled walls and floors, WC, WHB, cubicle shower\r\n\r\nFirst floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n2.55 x 3.60m\r\nDouble bedroom to the front.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n3.90 x 3.65m\r\nWardrobe.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n4.50 x 2.90m\r\nWardrobe. Shelved hotpress.\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n1.70 x 2.50m\r\nTiled walls and floors, WC & WHB, bath\r\n\r\nBedroom 4\r\n2.35 x 3.50m\r\nBuilt-in wardrobe."
